WEBVTT

00:00:00.549 --> 00:00:01.070
Hello!

00:00:01.097 --> 00:00:04.430
After a treatment, customers often want to take a product home with them.

00:00:04.752 --> 00:00:08.190
With VaraaAi, your salon has its own online shop:

00:00:08.379 --> 00:00:11.230
customers order online, and collect at the salon.

00:00:11.590 --> 00:00:14.430
Let me show you how to add products, and handle orders.

00:00:15.062 --> 00:00:17.788
Tap Products, then tap Add product.

00:00:18.065 --> 00:00:19.708
First, add photos:

00:00:19.817 --> 00:00:22.348
up to eight, and the first photo is the cover.

00:00:22.696 --> 00:00:26.028
Then fill in the product name, the brand, and a description.

00:00:26.696 --> 00:00:29.072
Scroll down to Pricing, and enter the price.

00:00:29.315 --> 00:00:31.952
If it's on sale, add the regular price too.

00:00:32.449 --> 00:00:35.392
Switch on Featured to pin the product to the top of your shop.

00:00:35.646 --> 00:00:36.272
Run out?

00:00:36.344 --> 00:00:37.472
Switch on Sold out:

00:00:37.821 --> 00:00:40.352
the product is still shown, but can't be ordered.

00:00:40.556 --> 00:00:42.752
When you're done, tap Save product.

00:00:43.408 --> 00:00:46.516
The product appears in your list, and in your salon's shop.

00:00:46.865 --> 00:00:50.996
Tap View shop to see it as customers do, or Copy link to send it to them.

00:00:51.607 --> 00:00:54.857
When a customer places an order, it appears under Orders.

00:00:55.023 --> 00:00:58.784
Each order shows who it's from, what they ordered, how they're paying,

00:00:58.734 --> 00:01:00.057
and the customer's note.

00:01:00.401 --> 00:01:03.337
When they collect it, tap Handed over, complete.

00:01:03.764 --> 00:01:05.417
Tap Print slip if you need one.

00:01:05.781 --> 00:01:07.817
The customer gets an email at each step.

00:01:08.086 --> 00:01:09.337
Now take the quiz below.
